    "description": "After the death of your mother, Sarah, and the fall of the Consortium, you infiltrate the Phoenix Complex seeking revenge. \r\n\r\nOnce inside the complex, your main mission changes completely: you must find a way to escape alive. To do so, you'll have to delve deep and thoroughly explore the complex's workers' area, an industrial sector filled with dark corridors, blocked entrances, and traps.\r\n\r\nThroughout your journey, Byte's help will be crucial. Together with Byte, you'll have to solve various puzzles and riddles. However, the pressure is constant: while using your ingenuity to solve the enigmas of the environment, you must maintain absolute stealth. Maxin is lurking, stalking around every corner, and he won't stop until he finds you. Avoid drawing attention, hide when necessary, and don't let Maxin kill you on your way out.",
